      "comment": "LOVE SYMBOL (4) has a moderate winning strike-rate but did a good job when returning from a break last time at this track, flashing home to just miss. Fitter and keeps Johnny Allen. Have to take seriously. ENDLESS FOREVERS (3) was in the firing line on the bend and progressed nicely last start to just miss the bob over this track and trip. Only needs to hold her form to be right there again. CHILLCUZ (6) made an encouraging return earlier this month but hasn't been able to go on with it in her last two, despite the market support. Backs up quickly here and is worth another chance on peak figures. BLISS BOMB (2) chased gamely into the placings here last time and should be hitting her straps fourth-up. In the mix.",
